+// Cinders of Chaos engine patch 0021 (server/src-patches/0021-client-guard.patch): only the official client may play.
+// Part of the engine, under its GPL-2.0 License (LICENSE in the server source root).
+//
+// Two checks, both configured in config.lua (server/README.md "Client guard"):
+//  1. login gate: the u32 "client version" field of both login packets (account login and game login) must carry
+//     CLIENT_ID_TAG in its high 16 bits and an accepted build number in its low 16 bits (stock clients send 1098);
+//  2. handshake: after the game login the server sends a random nonce on extended opcode HANDSHAKE_OPCODE and the
